---
import { BUSINESS } from '../consts';

const stats = [
  { value: `Depuis ${BUSINESS.founded}`, label: 'entreprise artisanale' },
  { value: 'RGE', label: 'qualification — aides de l’État' },
  { value: '100 %', label: 'sur mesure' },
];

const marquee = ['Plafonds & faux plafonds', 'Cloisons & doublage', 'Meubles sur mesure', 'Isolation intérieure', 'Rénovation RGE'];
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-svh flex-col overflow-hidden">
  <img
    src="/logo/logo-512.png"
    alt=""
    aria-hidden="true"
    width="512"
    height="512"
    class="reveal d2 float absolute right-6 top-28 z-10 hidden h-24 w-auto opacity-90 md:right-12 md:top-32 md:block md:h-32 lg:h-40"
  />

  <svg class="spin-slow absolute left-[8%] top-[24%] h-5 w-5 text-lime/60 md:left-[14%] md:h-8 md:w-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M12 1l2.4 8.6L23 12l-8.6 2.4L12 23l-2.4-8.6L1 12l8.6-2.4z" />
  </svg>
  <svg class="float slow absolute bottom-[28%] left-[16%] h-3 w-3 text-lime/40 md:h-5 md:w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M12 1l2.4 8.6L23 12l-8.6 2.4L12 23l-2.4-8.6L1 12l8.6-2.4z" />
  </svg>

  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 pb-16 pt-36 text-center md:px-10 md:pt-40">
    <p class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-pale/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-sage backdrop-blur">
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-lime ring-2 ring-lime/30" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Artisan plaquiste — {BUSINESS.locality} · Pays de Nay (64)
    </p>

    <h1 class="reveal d1 mt-8 max-w-5xl font-display text-[12.5vw] font-medium leading-[1.0] tracking-[-0.035em] sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl lg:text-[6.75rem]">
      Plafonds, cloisons
      <span class="text-sage">&amp;</span><br />
      meubles
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pale via-lime-soft to-lime bg-clip-text font-light text-transparent">sur&nbsp;mesure</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="reveal d2 mt-8 max-w-xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-sage">
      En plaque de plâtre, nous façonnons vos intérieurs en neuf comme en rénovation —
      du plafond travaillé au meuble décoratif, jusqu’à l’isolation par l’intérieur.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal d2 mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="rounded-full bg-lime px-7 py-3.5 text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-night shadow-lg shadow-lime/20 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-lime-soft hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-lime/30"
      >
        Demander un devis gratuit
      </a>
      <a
        href="#realisations"
        class="rounded-full border border-pale/25 bg-white/5 px-7 py-3.5 text-[13px] font-medium tracking-wide backdrop-blur transition-colors hover:border-pale"
      >
        Voir les réalisations
      </a>
    </div>

    <dl class="reveal d3 mt-16 grid w-full max-w-3xl grid-cols-1 gap-5 border-t border-pale/10 pt-7 sm:grid-cols-3">
      {stats.map((s) => (
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center gap-3 sm:block">
          <dt class="font-display text-2xl font-medium">{s.value}</dt>
          <dd class="text-[13px] text-sage sm:mt-1">{s.label}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>
  </div>

  <div class="relative border-t border-pale/10 py-4" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="flex overflow-hidden [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,transparent,black_15%,black_85%,transparent)]">
      <div class="marquee-track flex w-max items-center gap-10 pr-10">
        {[...marquee, ...marquee, ...marquee].map((m) => (
          <span class="flex items-center gap-10 whitespace-nowrap font-display text-sm tracking-wide text-pale/40">
            {m}
            <svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-lime" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 1l2.4 8.6L23 12l-8.6 2.4L12 23l-2.4-8.6L1 12l8.6-2.4z" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
